body:
Thank you for your comments.
@markstory Sure. I would like to throw an exception simply.
@lorenzo Sorry, I don't understand your concern. When an exception is thrown, it means *unusual*. So we shouldn't continue usual operation silently. Even now, ORM may get some PDOException. What is the difference between throwing a NestedTransactionRollbackException and that? 
@inoas Agreed. I think almost all people would expect it.
